{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:13:07Z","created_by_operation":"op_c1ecb2a6ab9c409f8b0bea70cdd5cc55","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5e3a3ae0210e6c8eb2a50351ec5f34f3556557f348782890cdb11b6b8cce3666","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=relevance","setting":"oinone/oinone-pamirs@32d4a041f66d snapshot bd4cb50b77491110","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_cd5c812c66b322221894448f748c071eb5166e3366ac480350b346ef80b1fb14"],"source_ids":["src_4dc587f9c3c95df0aca657f66dfc4255"],"text":"The framework targets developers, enterprise R&D teams, and software companies, with claimed served customers across domains such as MES, APS, ERP, HIS, and OMS.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:13:07Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c1ecb2a6ab9c409f8b0bea70cdd5cc55"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:13:07Z","created_by_operation":"op_c1ecb2a6ab9c409f8b0bea70cdd5cc55","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_85ac778e5c51ec8768337477310bfe7998e726e66e993ab4d6ca4d879745a6fc","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"oinone/oinone-pamirs@32d4a041f66d snapshot bd4cb50b77491110","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8d3bc139372aedb5df506643cd586f21b0a4908a988198264869478561bcf6b5"],"source_ids":["src_4dc587f9c3c95df0aca657f66dfc4255"],"text":"Applications built on the framework are said to inherently include a Data-Feedback Loop (DFL) mechanism supporting a lifecycle of training, modeling, execution, evaluation, and autonomous execution.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:13:07Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c1ecb2a6ab9c409f8b0bea70cdd5cc55"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:13:07Z","created_by_operation":"op_c1ecb2a6ab9c409f8b0bea70cdd5cc55","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_865090c0d7c896009f31634128591485f3f7f7b20ebc0b261f9ce0d98b92d39d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"oinone/oinone-pamirs@32d4a041f66d snapshot bd4cb50b77491110","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_58bcfd0086650d959fc1ff5f1ec3c8b4ae1324bc88f7a12a9a10a30a00f8fa95","slc_8d3bc139372aedb5df506643cd586f21b0a4908a988198264869478561bcf6b5"],"source_ids":["src_4dc587f9c3c95df0aca657f66dfc4255"],"text":"The framework self-describes as 100% metadata-driven, combining metadata-driven design with visual no-code design as a standardized development discipline rather than a free-form scaffold.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:13:07Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c1ecb2a6ab9c409f8b0bea70cdd5cc55"}
